          mysterious identity.
        </p>

        <h3>Design Concept</h3>
        <p>
          The white base makes the skull design more visible and striking. The painted areas around
          the face create the feeling of a mask or skull face.
        </p>

        <h3>Theme Connection</h3>
        <p>
          This piece connects directly to bones, skulls, and winter. The white color makes the design
          feel closer to actual bone, while the darker details add contrast.
        </p>

        <h3>Why It Matters</h3>
        <p>
          The white balaclava adds contrast to the collection. It gives the brand a brighter but still
          eerie piece that works with both sweaters.
